hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"972","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ke paas zameen khaali ho to wo us mein kashtkaari karay. Agar khud na karay to aur kisi ko de, bator riayat bila kiraya, ke wo us mein kashtkaari karay. (Muslim: 5/19). Baab: Zameen kiraya par dena."
"973","[AI-translation] Rafi bin Khadij (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ahad mein muhaqala kiya kartay thay. Zameen ko sulus, ruba paidaawar aur muayyan anaaj par kiraya detay. Aik roz hamaray paas mere chachaon mein se aik aaya aur kehnay laga ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein us kaam se mana kiya jis mein hamara faida tha, lekin Allah aur us ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki khushi mein hamein zyada faida hai, hamein muhaqala se yani zameen ko sulus ya ruba paidaawar par ya muayyan miqdaar par kiraya par chalanay se mana kiya gaya hai. Aur hukm farmaya hai ke zameen ka maalik khud us mein khaiti karay ya doosray ko khaiti ke liye de day aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kiraya par ya kisi aur tarah par dena bura jana hai. (Muslim: 5/23). Baab: Zameen sonay chandi ke badlay kiraya par dena."
"974","[AI-translation] Hanzala bin Qais Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rafi bin Khadij (raziyallahu anhu) se zameen ko sonay aur chandi ke badlay kiraya par denay ke baaray mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha ke is mein koi qabahaat nahi. Log Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ahad mein nehar ke kinaron par aur naaliyon ke saron par paidaawar par zameen kiraya par chalatay thay to baaz auqaat aik cheez talaf ho jati aur doosri bach jati aur kabhi ye talaf ho jati aur wo bach jati, to logon ko kuch kiraya na milta magar wohi jo bach rehta, is liye Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne is se mana farmaya. Lekin agar kiraya ke badlay koi muayyan cheez, jaisay rupiya ashrafi ghalla waghera, jis ki zimma daari ho sakay to is mein koi qabahaat nahi hai. (Muslim: 5/24). Baab: Muajira. (Maziyanaat baray nehar ki jama hai; manay ka matlab ye hai ke wo zameen kashtkaar ko beej us ke paas se de kar detay ke maalik ko nehron kinaron wali paidaawar milay, is mein dhokay ki wajah se mana kiya; mumaniat ki illat dhoka aur jahalat hai.)"
"975","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Saib kehtay hain ke ham Abdullah bin Miqal (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas gaye aur un se muzaraat, batai, ke baaray mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha ke Sabit (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne muzaraat se mana kiya aur muajira ka, yani rupay ashrafi par kiraya chalanay ka, hukm farmaya aur farmaya ke is mein koi qabahaat nahi hai. (Muslim: 5/25). (Asal mein wa Rasoolullah tha, Muslim se tasheeh hai.)"
"976","[AI-translation] Taus se riwayat hai ke wo mukhabara kartay thay to Amr, Taus se, kehtay hain ke main ne un, Taus, se kaha ke Ae Abu Abdur Rahman! Agar tum mukhabara ko chhor do to behtar hai, kyunke log kehtay hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mukhabara, zameen ko batai kar denay, se mana kiya hai to Taus ne kaha ke Ae Amr! Mujh se us shakhs ne bayan kiya jo sahaba mein zyada jannay wala tha yani Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mukhabara se mana nahi kiya balke yun farmaya ke agar tum mein se koi apne bhai ko muft zameen de day to muayyan ujrat kiraya le kar denay se behtar hai. (Muslim: 5/25). Baab: Musaqaat aur zameen ka phal aur anaaj ke hissay par muamla."
"977","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar ko, Khaibar walon ke, hawalay is shart par kiya ke jo phal ya anaaj paida ho wo aadha hamara hai aur aadha tumhara. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apni azwaaj-e-mutahharat (raziyallahu anhunna) ko har saal sau wasq detay, jin mein assi, 80, wasq khajoor ke aur bees, 20, jau ke. Jab Umar (raziyallahu anhu) khalifa banay aur amwaal-e-Khaibar ko taqseem kiya to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki azwaaj-e-mutahharat (raziyallahu anhunna) ko ikhtiyar diya ke ya to tum bhi zameen aur pani ka hissa le lo ya apne wasq leti raho to wo mukhtalif ho gayeen, baazon ne zameen aur pani liya aur baazon ne wasq lena manzoor kiya. Ummul Momineen Aisha aur Hafsa (raziyallahu anhuma) zameen aur pani lenay walon mein se thin. (Muslim: 5/26). Baab: Jis ne poda lagaya. (Wasq oont ka bojh hai, saath sa' hai; qasama se murad mustahiqqeen mein taqseem hai.)"
"978","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo Musalman darakht lagaye phir us mein se koi khaye, to laganay walay ko sadqa ka sawab milay ga aur jo chori ho jaye ga us mein bhi sadqa ka sawab milay ga aur jo darinday kha jayein, us mein bhi sadqa ka sawab milay ga aur jo parinday kha jayein, us mein bhi sadqa ka sawab milay ga aur us phal ko koi kam na karay ga, magar sadqa ka sawab us ko milta rahay ga. (Muslim: 5/27). Baab: Zaaid pani baichna. (Yarzauhu se murad kami karna hai.)"
"979","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne zaroorat se zaaid pani baichnay se mana farmaya. (Muslim: 5/34). Baab: Zaaid pani aur ghaas roknay ki mumaniat."
"980","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke zaaid pani is wajah se na roka jaye ke us ki wajah se ghaas bhi roki jaye. (Muslim: 5/34). (Laam aqibat ke liye hai; kala se murad ghaas hai; soorat ye hai ke jungle mein kunwan ho aur charagah ho, pani roknay se charai ruk jati hai.)"
